{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"# Gestion Guichet/Chargé de clientèle"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## Composant Guichet \r\n![picture 0](../../../images/d98cdf3f9946cdb6ea8fcef767befa55cf0b104c45ec6bc27b8c545316d69d74.png)  \r\n\r\nSTRMENUST/STRGUIOUV/GUIOUV   \r\n\r\n- solde du caisson via appel du CALCAS (position via CAISSLD puis maj via mouvements de FINAMVTL6)"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## Liste Clients\r\n- liste des clients : nom, prenom, adresse, etc\r\n![picture 2](../../../images/9c2dec813206f375b2c06bb5f347f6faa7d128cd48c58d23f465f06902be8928.png)  \r\n\r\nCLIMAJ\r\n- nombre de contrat via boucle sur le fichier contrat des contrats actifs ('ENG','ENS','PRO','PRV','MEV')\r\n- montant total des contrats ==> montant global des contrats des contrats actifs ('ENG','ENS','PRO','PRV','MEV')"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["sql"]},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/markdown":"|AGENCE_ID|ID|NOM_COMPLET|DATENAISSANCE|PAYSNAISSANCE|VILLENAISSANCE|VILLE|TELEPHONE1|TELEPHONE2|TYPEIDENTIT|NUMEROIDENTIT|NBRCTR|TOTALPRETCTR|\n|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|\n|NAN|NAN0001488|BA ANTA|1955-07-01|SN|DAKAR|NANTES|641213997|0|CI|921144200791|1|6010|\n|NAN|NAN0023988|BA AMINATA|1960-01-01|MR|M BAGNE|NANTES|766048426|0|CI|DWN420D09|4|2950|\n"},"metadata":{}}],"source":"select c.agecli as agence_id,c.etacli || digits(c.codcli) as id,trim(c.nomcli) || ' ' || trim(c.prncli) as nom_complet,\r\nc.dnacli as dateNaissance,c.pnacli as paysNaissance,c.vnacli as villeNaissance, a.viladc as ville, c.tl1cli as telephone1, c.tl2cli as telephone2,c.tidcli as typeIdentit,c.nidcli as numeroIdentit,\r\nctr.nbrCtr, ctr.totalPretCtr\r\n from cmspsgfic.clients c \r\n left join cmspsgfic.clieadr a on a.etaadc = c.etacli and a.cliadc = c.codcli and a.natadc ='R'\r\nleft join (\r\nselect etacon,clicon,count(*) nbrCtr, sum(mntcon) totalPretCtr from cmspsgfic.contrat where poscon in ('ENG','ENS','PRO','PRV','MEV') group by etacon,clicon\r\n) ctr on ctr.etacon = c.etacli and ctr.clicon = c.codcli\r\n where c.etacli = 'NAN' and c.agecli = 'NAN' and c.nomcli like 'B%' order by c.nomcli limit 2;  "},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["sql"]},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/markdown":"|00001|\n|----|\n|245753|\n"},"metadata":{}}],"source":"select count(*) from (\r\nselect *\r\n from cmspsgfic.clients c \r\n left join cmspsgfic.clieadr a on a.etaadc = c.etacli and a.cliadc = c.codcli and a.natadc ='R'\r\nleft  join (\r\nselect etacon,clicon,count(*) nbrCtr, sum(mntcon) totalPretCtr from cmspsgfic.contrat where poscon in ('ENG','ENS','PRO','PRV','MEV') group by etacon,clicon\r\n) ctr on ctr.etacon = c.etacli and ctr.clicon = c.codcli\r\n);\r\n "},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## Résumé des contrats\r\n![picture 3](../../../images/629103561f02d2535591b225fb39fa85904cd796ebcff84fe8bd4d140390635a.png)  \r\nfenêtre CLIMAJ04 de CLIMAJFM."},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["sql"]},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/markdown":"|ETACOB|POSCON|CONCOB|CA|00005|NBOBJET|00007|\n|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|\n|NAN|DEG|123000204|400|400|2|0|\n|NAN|DEG|123000471|600|600|5|0|\n|NAN|DEG|124000197|750|750|3|0|\n|NAN|DEG|-|0|605|10|1|\n|NAN|PRO|624013664|1200|1200|1|0|\n|NAN|PRO|624013666|750|750|3|0|\n|NAN|PRO|624013667|600|600|5|0|\n|NAN|PRO|624013668|400|400|2|0|\n|NAN|PRO|-|0|659.09|11|1|\n|NAN|-|-|0|633.33|21|1|\n|-|-|-|0|633.33|21|1|\n"},"metadata":{}}],"source":"select etacob,poscon,concob,\r\nCASE\r\n WHEN GROUPING(concob) = 0  then sum(mntcon)/count(*)\r\n WHEN  GROUPING(concob) = 1  then 0\r\nEND ca,\r\nsum(mntcon)/count(*) ,count(*) nbObjet,GROUPING(concob)  from (\r\nselect cob.*,ctr.poscon,ctr.mntcon from cmspsgfic.contobj cob  \r\nleft join cmspsgfic.contrat ctr on ctr.etacon = cob.etacob and ctr.numcon = cob.concob\r\nwhere ctr.etacon = 'NAN' and ctr.clicon = 0023988)\r\n GROUP BY ROLLUP (etacob,poscon,concob);"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## liste des contrats\r\n\r\n![picture 4](../../../images/f4898ceddb25ea47563c8bae60e4d65f1410488c7310dac756e49f284c4a8386.png)  \r\n\r\n"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["sql"]},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/markdown":"|ETACON|CLICON|NUMCON|POSCON|MESCON|MNTCON|NBRCON|DAECON|\n|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|----|\n|NAN|23988|624013668|PRO|625|400|2|2026-01-25|\n|NAN|23988|624013667|PRO|750|600|2|2026-01-25|\n|NAN|23988|624013666|PRO|938|750|2|2026-01-25|\n|NAN|23988|624013664|PRO|1500|1200|2|2026-01-25|\n|NAN|23988|124000197|DEG|940|750|0|2024-07-18|\n|NAN|23988|123000471|DEG|750|600|2|2024-08-14|\n|NAN|23988|123000204|DEG|630|400|2|2024-07-23|\n"},"metadata":{}}],"source":"-- liste des contrats\r\nselect etacon,clicon,numcon,poscon,mescon,mntcon,nbrcon,daecon from cmspsgfic.contrat where etacon = 'NAN' and clicon = 0023988;"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## identité liste des documents.\r\n![picture 5](../../../images/209da58455d23af152bcaf4a2cbcb97eea833f47c8986ad41fd1c309c2a8f0fc.png)  \r\n\r\n![picture 6](../../../images/e87e93ba395e974b94c194ed927163cb0fdd0e8106f207079e3838bcc91cf85f.png)  \r\n\r\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## Liste des justificatifs de revenus.\r\n![picture 7](../../../images/b6f30dd7d847e4c2bfb65549792ba9342f7173de6a6b7d12df65d641c8bc50f2.png) \r\nprogramme CLIJRM \r\n"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["sql"]},"outputs":[],"source":"-- liste des justificatifs de revenus \r\nSELECT a.*,j.libjrv FROM CMSPSGFIC.CLIEJRV as a\r\nleft join CMSPSGFIC.PARAjrv as j on a.jrvjrv =j.codjrv; "},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## Simulations\r\n![picture 8](../../../images/cbffd46abb6771f852bc6df4f77ff17658ef28b978331f1c62ddb7ff4f68cdfc.png)  \r\nprogramme CONSIM"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## Rendez vous clients\r\n![picture 9](../../../images/281dd2ae36fab2fdd9158e1f0352c83bff942374bec1ed3f0b1d64f1971afc98.png)  \r\nprogramme CLIRDM"},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"tags":["sql"]},"outputs":[],"source":"SELECT * FROM CMSPSGFIC.CLIERDV as a;"},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":"## liste des oppositions\r\n![picture 10](../../../images/9307ccdd709f7a70f482f2ffd1e4bacf06274e9e525398f68d4106198a11fb08.png)  \r\ngéré dans le climaj."}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"DB2 for IBM i","name":"db2i"},"language_info":{"name":"sql","file_extension":"sql"}},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":0}